                "metadata": {
                    "category": "podcast",
                    "description": "The Unexplainable Disappearance of Mars Patel is a mystery adventure show for kids that the whole family will enjoy. \n\nIn the show, eleven-year-old Mars Patel and his pals Caddie, JP, and Toothpick must band together to discover why kids are going missing at H.G. Wells Middle School. Tech billionaire Oliver Pruitt, founder of the mysterious school, Pruitt Prep, may have a thing or two to say about their quest and where it will lead. Will it be, as he is fond of saying, To the Stars? \n\nFor more great shows for kids and families visit GZMshows.com.",
